18870.patch","merged_at":"2026-06-25T13:37:19Z"},"body":"These are essentially copies of `TightLocalVector` sizes. It's simply better to ask the vector for its size instead of storing them in the stream class.\r\n\r\nData in the past used to be direct allocations that were freed on the destructor instead of vectors, so sizes are leftovers of that.\r\n\r\nAs for `AudioStreamPlaybackWAV::QOA_State::dec_len`, despite looking like a place to store size, is actually a dummy variable because `qoa_decode_frame()` requires a place to write the decoded length and is unused otherwise.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118870/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118870/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}